 "subtitle": "You are the dungeon's keeper. Dig, build rooms, pay your creatures, smash the heroes.",
 "intro": "Your dungeon is a heart in the rock and three imps. Mark rock to dig (▦ Mark, dig): the glittering squares are gold, and the imps carry it to the heart or a treasury. Mark rooms on open floor (lair, hatchery, treasury, training room, library, workshop, prison): a finished room big enough draws a creature through the portal. Every 8 hours is pay day: 💰 Pay wages, or face a creature council. Heroes come in from the south gate at night. Powers: ✋ the hand (pick up, then 👇 drop), 👋 slap, ✚ heal, 🚩 call to arms, and ⚡ lightning once the library has researched it. ⏸ and ×2 control time.",
